Codex Usage Tray source packages for Launchpad
==============================================

The package uses Debian source format 3.0 (quilt).  The upstream archive is
created directly from the immutable v0.2.1 Git tag and therefore excludes the
Debian packaging directory.  Do not use the pre-built .deb from GitHub Releases
for PPA uploads; Launchpad accepts the signed source upload and builds binaries
itself.

Run the following commands from the repository root to create unsigned source
packages for both supported Ubuntu LTS series:

    debian/build-ppa-source noble
    debian/build-ppa-source resolute

The generated files are placed below build/ppa/<series>/.  Noble uses
0.2.1-1~ppa1~noble1 and includes the shared upstream orig.tar.xz.  Resolute uses
0.2.1-1~ppa1~resolute1 and its _source.changes omits the
already-uploaded orig archive.  Upload Noble first and wait for Launchpad to
accept it before uploading Resolute.

Sign the .dsc and _source.changes files with the Launchpad-associated OpenPGP
key only after all validation has passed.  Never export the private key.
